<view class="page-shell"><navigation-bar title="常用设置" back="{{true}}" color="#262822" background="#F5F1E8"></navigation-bar><scroll-view class="settings-scroll" scroll-y enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="settings-content"><text class="eyebrow">YOUR KITCHEN</text><text class="settings-title">把长期习惯留在这里</text><text class="settings-intro">本轮条件不会未经确认写入这里。当前为本机 mock 存储，接入账号后再做跨设备同步。</text><view class="setting-card"><text class="setting-label">明确不吃的食材</text><text class="setting-help">仅填写你确认要长期排除的具体食材，用顿号分隔。</text><textarea placeholder="例如：香菜、花生" value="{{excludeText}}" bindinput="onExcludeInput" maxlength="100" /></view><view class="setting-card"><text class="setting-label">确认常备的食材</text><text class="setting-help">只记录种类，不代表数量足够；油盐也不会被默认补上。</text><textarea placeholder="例如：鸡蛋、大米、生抽" value="{{pantryText}}" bindinput="onPantryInput" maxlength="100" /></view><view class="capability-card"><view><text>严格时间与人数</text><text>等待 verified 数据</text></view><text class="status-off">暂不可用</text></view><view class="capability-card"><view><text>省事程度</text><text>等待主动操作/负担模型</text></view><text class="status-off">暂不可用</text></view><button class="primary-button save-button" bindtap="save">保存设置</button><button class="clear-button" bindtap="clear">清空全部设置</button><view class="dev-tools"><text>开发预览工具</text><button bindtap="simulateFailure">下一次推荐模拟网络失败</button></view><view class="safe-bottom"></view></view></scroll-view></view>
